    "detailed_description": "<h1>Consider Kill It With Fire</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Teleport, shift through bullets, and master lightning-fast takedowns in an all new kind of action game from tinyBuild and Team Shifty!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489140/extras/eeecd732587c2e853063c3939faf89e3.poster.avif?t=1727200337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489140/extras/eeecd732587c2e853063c3939faf89e3.webm?t=1727200337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489140/extras/eeecd732587c2e853063c3939faf89e3.mp4?t=1727200337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shift through walls, through bullets, cover huge distances and be everywhere at once<br></li><li>One shot kills. Survive on skills.<br></li><li>Use distraction, trickery, explore what's possible when stealth and action become one!<br></li><li>Toy with enemies, laugh as they use doors to enter rooms<br></li><li>Underestimate enemies, and cry as they use group tactics to outsmart Shifty</li></ul><br>A group of industry veterans behind 21 games, from GameBoy Advance to Xbox 360, have joined together to raise the bar for independent games: Team Shifty's action-packed debut is a must play!",
    "about_the_game": "Teleport, shift through bullets, and master lightning-fast takedowns in an all new kind of action game from tinyBuild and Team Shifty!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489140/extras/eeecd732587c2e853063c3939faf89e3.poster.avif?t=1727200337\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489140/extras/eeecd732587c2e853063c3939faf89e3.webm?t=1727200337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/489140/extras/eeecd732587c2e853063c3939faf89e3.mp4?t=1727200337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shift through walls, through bullets, cover huge distances and be everywhere at once<br></li><li>One shot kills. Survive on skills.<br></li><li>Use distraction, trickery, explore what's possible when stealth and action become one!<br></li><li>Toy with enemies, laugh as they use doors to enter rooms<br></li><li>Underestimate enemies, and cry as they use group tactics to outsmart Shifty</li></ul><br>A group of industry veterans behind 21 games, from GameBoy Advance to Xbox 360, have joined together to raise the bar for independent games: Team Shifty's action-packed debut is a must play!",
